msgctxt "108"
msgid "I can't give you what I don't got!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Quit lying and pay back that money, jackass!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "What the...?"
msgstr "Ma che..."

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Wahaha! You'll never catch me like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Dammit! That asshole is quick..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "Che succede qui?"

msgctxt "180"
msgid "What the hell? Outta the way! I'm in a hurry, here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Shit, he got away! Dammit, look what you⑬ Wait...\r\n"
"Are you... you wouldn't happen to be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"You aren't Kiryu-san, fourth chairman of the Tojo Clan,\r\n"
"are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "That's right. Do we know each other?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"You don't know me, but I sure as hell know you! I can't\r\n"
"believe I ran into you here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"I didn't think I'd ever get to meet you. I heard this\r\n"
"rumor you'd left the city. Really, it's an honor, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Right. Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry about that! Call me Shibayama. I'm a debt\r\n"
"collector."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "So a loan shark, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I never made it into the yakuza like you, but I always\r\n"
"looked up to you during your old loan collectin' days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Hell, we've got legends of the stuff you did collecting for\r\n"
"the Dojima Family!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Is that so? Not much of a happy ending to those legends,\r\n"
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"I got into loan collecting because I wanted to climb the\r\n"
"yakuza ladder just like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Oh, yeah? Well, good luck with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"But there's this guy Motoyama who's really pissing me off.\r\n"
"He's got the cash to pay, but he just keeps running off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "And that's not all! This creep's a real piece of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"He tries to trick women and even his own friends into paying\r\n"
"off his loans for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Hey, I know! Do you think you could help me catch him?\r\n"
"I'd really like to see your work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "You really ought to be able to do this yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Okay. I'm sure I'll figure something out on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"But if you ever change your mind, I'll probably be\r\n"
"somewhere around here, trying to chase down Motoyama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"This guy Motoyama sounds like a real scumbag. I guess\r\n"
"I could help you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"I really appreciate it! And hey, maybe I can learn a thing\r\n"
"or two by watching you work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "So, what do you want me to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Well, I just got a tip the bastard just made 1,000,000\r\n"
"yen off the horse races. I want him to pay off our loan\r\n"
"before he uses it all up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "This is a photo of Motoyama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"The jerk owes us 1,000,000 yen, but he's an idiot when\r\n"
"it comes to money. He just spends whatever he's got in his\r\n"
"pocket."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"We gotta find him and get him to pay back that loan before\r\n"
"he spends it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "This guy really does sound like a pain in the ass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"I'll call you whenever I get a tip about his whereabouts.\r\n"
"Beat him up or whatever you have to do, just get that\r\n"
"money back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"And whatever you can get back for me, I'll give you ten\r\n"
"percent. Just remember that the faster you catch him, the\r\n"
"bigger reward you'll get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"Got it. I'll give you my phone number. Call me when you\r\n"
"know where he's at."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Okay, will do! And thanks again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Help Him"
msgstr "Aiutalo"

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Maybe Later"
msgstr "Magari dopo."

